    <figure>
      <img src="/images/reminder-swimming.webp" width="800" height="480" loading="lazy" alt="A 5 pm reminder in Italian: Pack the swimming bag." />
      <figcaption>The text-only version, rendered by the display code with an invented Italian sentence.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <p>On a display with several jobs, reminders take precedence over activity instructions, which take precedence over pictures. When the higher-priority content ends, the content underneath becomes visible again.</p>
